data: {"id": "2e312595996443e3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1044", "run_id": "2e312595996443e3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具事实，对 `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` 的 NotReady 问题进行证据分析：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc`，UID `705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee`。\n- **归属**: ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45` -> Deployment `workload`。\n- **调度**: 运行在 `node2` (IP: 10.2.0.50)，Pod IP `172.16.104.16`。\n- **容器**: 仅包含一个名为 `app` 的容器，镜像为 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`。\n- **当前状态**: Phase 为 `Running`，但 `Ready` 状态为 `False`，原因是 `ContainersNotReady` (container `app` 未就绪)。\n\n##", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789088145611, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

