依赖组件不可用。\n证据显示应用进程正在运行（Pod 状态 Running），但应用服务（监听在 `172.16.104.16:8080`）在处理就绪探针探测请求及正常业务请求（`/work` 路径）时，持续返回 HTTP 503 状态码，并伴有日志 `dependency unavailable`（证据 5、6、7）。Kubelet 的 Readiness Probe 因连续检测到 503 及偶发的 `connection refused`（证据 2、3），判定容器未就绪，从而将 Pod 的 `Ready` 条件置为 `False`（证据 1）。这导致该 Pod 被 Kubernetes 服务模型剔除，不再接收外部流量。故障并非由资源限制或 Pod 启动失败引起，而是应用层面的功能性服务中断。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 105.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc: 105.9s (Evidence 94.8s, RCA 11.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 140.689, "metrics": {"run_id": "2e312595996443e3", "mttr": {"value": "2.3m", "seconds": 140.693932056427, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight"